Six of the eight themes take their base colours from published open-source colour schemes.
Only colour values are used, and some of them are adjusted in lightness to reach the contrast
targets (4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for marks). No code, files or artwork from these projects is included.
The names identify where the colours come from; they do not imply endorsement.

